      "content": "{\"id\":\"TA-10\",\"title\":\"X~Bernoulli(0.3): P(X=0)=0.7, P(X=1)=0.3. F(0)=0.7, F(1)=1. Q(0.5)=inf{x:F(x)≥0.5}=0. Median=0 (the mode of this distribution).\",\"primitives\":[],\"addresses\":[]}",
