      "content": "{\"id\":\"TA-11\",\"title\":\"CORRECT → \\\"Q(p)=F⁻¹(p). Median=Q(0.5). IQR=Q(0.75)−Q(0.25). Exponential: median=ln2/λ<mean=1/λ. Inverse CDF method: X=Q(U), U~Uniform(0,1).\\\" → Gate (P91)\",\"primitives\":[\"P91\"],\"addresses\":[]}",
